{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55111","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看行动，只取（京本作「在」）日辰推。\n若在贵人前实是（京本作「是实」），三传同去此（辛本、川本作「此去」）无（京本作「此不须」）疑，反此却难移。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}